Hi @aaptel, Coverity flagged this with

```
*** CID 1467509:  Insecure data handling  (TAINTED_SCALAR)
/buildbot/builders/wireshark-master-vs-eca/vscodeanalysis/build/epan/dissectors/packet-smb2.c: 10227 in dissect_smb2_compression_pattern_v1()
10221     
10222     	proto_item_append_text(pat_item, " 0x%02x repeated %u times", pattern, times);
10223     
10224     	if (out) {
10225     		guint8 v = (guint8)pattern;
10226     
>>>     CID 1467509:  Insecure data handling  (TAINTED_SCALAR)
>>>     Using tainted variable "times" as a loop boundary.
10227     		for (guint i = 0; i < times; i++)
10228     			wmem_array_append(out, &v, 1);
10229     	}
10230     
10231     	return offset;
10232     }
```

Can you take a look?

